hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"287","We are Muhammad bin Abdul-Ala al-San’ani, we are Bishr, meaning Ibn Mufaddal, Amr bin Maymun told us. H Muhammad bin Al-Ala bin Kurayb, narrated to us Ibn Mubarak, narrated to us on the authority of Amr bin Maymun. H Muhammad bin Abdullah Al-Mukhurami narrated to us, Yazid bin Harun narrated to us, I am Amr bin Maymun, on the authority of Suleiman bin Yasar, on the authority of Aisha, “When the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, would wash his clothes with semen, then he would go out to pray, and I would look at a spot of “The traces of washing were on his clothes.” This is the wording of Al-Sana’ani, and in the hadith of Ibn Al-Mubarak, she said: “I was washing the dress of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, from the semen, and it came out And on his clothes were traces of water.” And in the hadith of Yazid bin Harun, he said: Suleiman bin Yassar told us, Aisha told me"
